{"about_the_game":"Idle Waters is a relaxing <strong>idle fishing game</strong> that <strong>waits for you</strong> while you do other things.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963540/extras/iw_text_fishing-bottom.png?t=1742483918\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963540/extras/iw_gif_bottom.gif?t=1742483918\" /><br>You can focus on other tasks while playing because it will stay at the bottom of your screen. You may zoom in or out, change the layout, or hide it completely.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963540/extras/iw_text_idle-fishing.png?t=1742483918\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963540/extras/iw_gif_fishing.gif?t=1742483918\" /><br>Unlike other games, the fish waits for you! When you are ready, click on the game to catch the fish.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963540/extras/iw_text_explore.png?t=1742483918\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963540/extras/iw_gif_explore.gif?t=1742483918\" /><br>Different ecosystems with unique fishes to catch.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963540/extras/iw_text_collection.png?t=1742483918\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963540/extras/iw_img_collection.png?t=1742483918\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963540/extras/iw_gif_variants.gif?t=1742483918\" /><br>Keep fishing to complete the collection with their color variants.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_